  "result": "Confirmed by reading both files directly.\n\n**Decision 1 — session lifetime set at sign-in:** `src/server/services/session-service.ts` — `SESSION_TTL_DAYS = 30` (line 17) and `createSessionToken()` (lines 27–38) compute `expiresAt = now + 30 days` when a session is minted at login.\n\n**Decision 2 — expiry enforced on a later request:** `src/lib/session.ts` — `getSessionPrincipal()` (lines 23–31) compares the stored `expiresAt` against `Date.now()` on every request and returns `null` when it's passed; that `null` is what dashboard layouts (e.g. `src/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx`) treat as \"not signed in\" and redirect to `/login`.\n\n(Note: `src/server/repositories/session-repository.ts` also filters out expired rows at the DB-query level, but that's a redundant lower-level duplicate of the same check — the actual per-request gate in the guard call path is `src/lib/session.ts`.)\n\nANSWER: src/server/services/session-service.ts, src/lib/session.ts",
